# Crystal Imperium play test: the phone rematch gate (src/battle_setup.c GetMaxRematchStageForBadges; the
# trainer standard's rule R1). A rematch tier made for a stage of the game (boss_teams.TEAM_STAGES, the
# upgraded Cooltrainers' since D47) is offered once the player reaches its stage, the first rematch too;
# before it, the player meets the tier before, or the first battle's team again. Heart & Soul's own tiers
# keep their level ceiling (sRematchLevelCeilingByBadges), the first rematch always offered.
# In 0.15.2 the ceiling held Cooltrainer Gaven's, Beth's and Reena's third tiers back until the sixteenth
# badge (their party data is at their stages' caps since D56): with eight badges and his second tier
# beaten, Gaven offered his second again.
# Each case: the player at a stage (its badges), the family's first tiers beaten, the trainer wanting a
# rematch (trainerRematches, as SetRematchIdForTrainer sets it), the player talks to them on their route,
# and the battle is against the tier the gate gives for the data (emu.py expected_rematch reads the tiers'
# stages, Heart & Soul's party levels and the ceiling table), one stage earlier the tier before.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!no_care_packages()
!set_flag("FLAG_DISABLE_TRAINERS")
!set_flag("FLAG_DISABLE_ENCOUNTERS")
!give_mon(157, 50)
savestate base.ss

# Cooltrainer Gaven, Route 26 (three tiers, all made for eight badges)
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_GAVEN_HNS", 8, 1, "gaven_8_badges_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_GAVEN_HNS", 7, 1, "gaven_7_badges_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_GAVEN_HNS", 8, 2, "gaven_8_badges_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_GAVEN_HNS", 7, 2, "gaven_7_badges_second_beaten")

# Cooltrainer Reena, Route 27 (tiers made for 7 badges, 8, and the Johto League won)
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_REENA_HNS", 8, 1, "reena_8_badges_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_REENA_HNS", 7, 1, "reena_7_badges_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_REENA_HNS", "J", 2, "reena_johto_champion_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_REENA_HNS", 8, 2, "reena_8_badges_second_beaten")

# Youngster Joey, Route 30 (five tiers, Heart & Soul's levels)
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", 3, 1, "joey_3_badges_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", 4, 2, "joey_4_badges_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", 3, 2, "joey_3_badges_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", 7, 3, "joey_7_badges_third_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", 6, 3, "joey_6_badges_third_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", "K", 4, "joey_kanto_champion_fourth_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_JOEY_HNS", "J", 4, "joey_johto_champion_fourth_beaten")

# Hiker Kenny, Route 13 (his third tier listed three times)
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_KENNY_HNS", "J", 1, "kenny_johto_champion_first_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_KENNY_HNS", "K", 2, "kenny_kanto_champion_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_KENNY_HNS", "J", 2, "kenny_johto_champion_second_beaten")
!rematch_battle("TRAINER_KENNY_HNS", "K", 3, "kenny_kanto_champion_third_beaten")
